'''Crustaceous Scissorex''' (超甲獣シザーレックス, ''Chō Kōjū Shizārekkusu'', '''Super Shell-Beast Scissorex''') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of [[Helmut Krabbe]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Crustaceous Scissorex
|image = E 606.png
|money drop = 1,600¢ - 6,320¢
|first appearance= [[Ashvini Desert]]<br>'''ZL''': [[Protons, Neutrons, and Morons|Sub-chapter 2 - Protons, Neutrons, and Morons]]
}}

==Enemy==
Crustaceous Scissorex is a very strong backliner boasting [[Wave Attack|Wave]] Immunity and huge damage, HP and range. Its already above-average range is further increased with its [[Multi-Hit]] attack, reaching 401 range on the first hit and 601 on the second. Don't forget that it can [[Slow|slow]] Cats on both hits, which makes it much harder for Cats to even reach it.

==Strategy==
Despite its long reach and high stats, its attack rate is fairly slow, so as long as you spam meatshields, a lone Scissorex can easily be pinned in place. Dealing damage to it is difficult, though, as its second hit reaches almost any [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] in the game. However, when Scissorex doesn't have enemies in front of it, speedy and/or tanky [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Aliens]] can prove useful. Examples include [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]], [[Blanka (Uber Rare Cat)|Blanka]], [[Mekako Saionji (Uber Rare Cat)|Mekako Saionji]], [[Lumina (Legend Rare Cat)|Lumina]], [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] and [[Doktor Heaven (Legend Rare Cat)|Doktor Heaven]]. [[Ancient Egg: N102 (Rare Cat)|Catarzan]] is a decent option, having effectiveness against both Aliens and Behemoths but lacking the endurance needed to become a definitive counter to it. If Scissorex has enemies in front of it, you can use [[:Category:Surge Attack Cats|Surge]] or [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance Cats]] to snipe it.

With [https://youtu.be/tikfQbXjQ9k good timing] and [[Battle Items#Sniper the Cat|Sniper the Cat]], rushers such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] can be sent into Crustaceous Scissorex's negative blind spot, where its lack of backwards range keeps it from hitting them.

